+- Moving a task (`/move`) requires the manager role in the source project and the contributor or manager role in the destination project (else 403; destination not readable → 404; archived source or destination → 409; destination equal to source → 400). The task keeps its ID, title, status and assignee. If the assignee is not a contributor or manager of the destination, the move is rejected with 400 and nothing changes.
 - Archived projects reject all writes with 409 (reads still work).
 - A task ID that does not belong to the project in the path → 404.
 
